title: intro_four_winds_beat6
---
<<show_narration "The Four Winds keeps a table nobody else wants. The usual table, the usual quiet, the rain coming down the glass the way it had been coming down all night.">>
<<show_narration "The drink tasted the way that building had felt. I don't have a better way to say it. Something had gone out of it before it reached me.">>
<<show_narration "Every time I set the glass down I was back in that lobby watching the ley terminal drop out. Readout dark for a second and a half, then back like nothing had happened, and the meter behind it never logged the gap.">>
<<show_narration "I keep a drawer for open cases and a drawer for closed ones. This didn't go in either. Nobody called. Not that night, not the one after it.">>
===
